      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "A cool down is a good idea, i agree. There are many people who will spam name changes, so if name changing is going to be a thing can we still see what their original game login name is so we dont get confused as to who is who now? On the social menu it'd say \"Character Name\" and \"Playername\". Character name they can change but Playername remains the same forever on their account. Hopefully on the Social Menu it also lists the playername first, but in the normal gameplay tag above their head can show their character name. (Im dreading the day that vrchat becomes \"overhead-tag-heavy\" like most games with Playername/ Charactername/class, etc. Right now just a single name is nice)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
